                        "entry_id": "71076f15-aeb3-37d7-914e-3f93771c737c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A follower of Comtism."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "historical"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "728264d1-2531-420e-bc6d-d8835792991f",
                                "sense_id": "67c96c0c-f947-3044-af0b-93710e54b77f",
                                "text": "I am not aware that there is any sect of Agnostics; and if there be, I am not its acknowledged prophet or pope. I desire to leave to the Comtists the entire monopoly of the manufacture of imitation ecclesiasticism."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0d2ffd69-8c7c-4092-95cb-e97953af03a5",
                                "sense_id": "67c96c0c-f947-3044-af0b-93710e54b77f",
                                "text": "The implied critique of the Comtists is clear: they imagined themselves an advance on the creators of putative sciences de l'homme, where they were in fact a wrong-headed deviation from the work initiated by their supposed intellectual progenitors."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
